"can skip any contours that are completely inside another contour.  note: "
"EXTERNAL_ONLY helps to avoid bright reflection spots from breaking up areas "
"of solid color.*"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-explore/color-locator-explore.rst:180
msgid ""
"Also, the display of contours (in the previews) can be turned ON or OFF:"
msgstr "また、輪郭の表示（プレビュー内）はONまたはOFFにすることができます："

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-explore/color-locator-explore.rst:184
msgid "Turning this on helps debugging but takes up valuable CPU time."
msgstr "これをオンにするとデバッグが助けられますが、貴重なCPU時間を消費します。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-explore/color-locator-explore.rst
